(2) Every regulation made under subsection (1) shall bepublished in the Gazette and shall come into operation onthe date of publication or on such later date as may bespecified therein.

(4) Notification of the date on which any regulationis deemed to be so rescinded shall be published in theGazette.

55. In the event of any inconsistency or conflict betweenthe provisions of this Act and any other written law, theprovisions of this Act shall prevail.

