(b)the provision of temporary accommodationincluding facilities for sustenance;

(c)the permanent or temporary re-location with theconsent of the victim of crime or witness, as thecase may be;

(d)the conducting of either the entirety or part of theproceedings in camera;

(e)the concealing of the identity of the victim of crimeor witness;

